ay with greed and gold this  is symbolized in the siren who is  adorned with gold jewelry and various  ornaments the siren in jabar lures the  men into a frenzy who fight each other  into the lake to get closer to her it's  a fool's errand as their armor sinks  them into the depths there is however  one survivor jabarro a death knight  impervious to the siren shrieks when you  watch this short from the lens of  colonialism the plot makes a lot more  sense the resource-rich siren or the  colonized in this scenario is sought  after by the conquistador or colonizer  at first the colonized is curious about  this new group the two even engage in a  macabre love affair only for the  colonizer to take full control and rape  both figuratively and literally the  knight takes everything from her ridding  the body of its riches and dumping it  when it ceases to be useful the siren's  body floats back from whence it came  unleashing a torrent of blood symbolic  of the bloodshed its people endured it's  only when the knight unknowingly drinks  of this blood the blood that he has shed  does he regain his hearing making him  susceptible to the siren's whale the  siren emerges from the lake now naked  and broken you can see the agony in her  face she lures the knight in and he like  those before him lay on the bottom among  a sea of dead bodies there are no  winners in this story the soldiers die  and the woman is left alone and broken  it's a tragedy caused by greed jabarro  is haunting and one of my favorites in  the entire love and death robots  universe but what did you think of this  season and which short made the top of  your list i want to know in the comments  below thanks for watching everyone be  sure to like and subscribe and for more  bad takes you can follow me on twitter  and instagram at thinkstoryyt until next  time remember this is where i come to  jurgo  you

